{title: Silsila}
{artist: Kanth Kaler}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Sapna te [A#] aakhir [Cm] Sapna si,        [Cm] Ainvayi taan [A#] ik din [Cm] tutna si
[Cm] Sapna te [A#] aakhir [Cm] Sapna si,        [Cm] Ainvayi taan [A#] ik din [Cm] tutna si
Changa [G#] hoya tut [Cm] gya,        [Cm] Ho tainu paun daa
[Cm] Tainu chaun daa,        Silsila [Fm] aithe hi muk [Cm] gya
[Cm] Ho tainu paun daa,        [Cm] Tainu chaun daa
Silsila [Fm] aithe hi muk [Cm] gya,        Sapna [Fm] te akhir Sapna [Cm] si
[Cm] Tainu pyaar karan daa,        Saleeka [Fm] aaya hi na
Assi [A#] dil to chaaya,        Te tu saanu [Cm] chaaya ni naa
[Cm] Tere hussan de assi [Gm] diwaane sa,        [Cm] Par tere laayi [Gm] begaane sa
[Fm] Dukh ae hi lutt [Cm] gya,        [Cm] Ho tainu paun daa
[Cm] Tainu chaun daa,        Silsila [Fm] aithe hi muk [Cm] gya
Sapna [Fm] te akhir Sapna [Cm] si,        [Cm] Tere dil diyan gallaan
Bulaan te [Fm] aiyan hi na,        Assi [A#] rahe samajh de
Te tu samj [Cm] haiyaan hi na,        [Cm] Tera Kamal Maan kade [Gm] sona si
[Cm] Hera da tummmy [Gm] aakhegi,        Eh [Fm] waqt hi rukk [Cm] gya
[Cm] Ho tainu paun daa,        [Cm] Tainu chaun daa
Silsila [Fm] aithe hi muk [Cm] gya
